# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmarks {#benchmarks}"
msgstr "Mga Benchmark {#benchmarks}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The benchmarks below show that the Constrained Quantum Optimizer Quantum Function is capable of finding high quality, feasible solutions to constrained optimization problems with well above 100 binary variables. Accuracy is the ratio of the found objective value to the known optimum. Runtime is wall-clock time from function invocation to result delivery. QPU usage is the billable Quantum Compute time.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng mga benchmark sa ibaba na kayang makahanap ng Constrained Quantum Optimizer Quantum Function ng high-quality at feasible na mga solusyon para sa constrained optimization problem na may higit na higit sa 100 binary variable. Ang accuracy ay ang ratio ng nakitang objective value sa kilalang optimum. Ang runtime ay ang wall-clock time mula sa pag-invoke ng function hanggang sa paghahatid ng resulta. Ang QPU usage ay ang billable Quantum Compute time.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two problems were examined: The [Maximum Independent Set](/tutorials/find-the-maximum-independent-set-with-aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) (MIS) problem and the Max-$k$-Cut, which is an extension of the well-known MaxCut problem to more than two categories. Max-$k$-Cut is also the optimization problem equivalent of the graph coloring decision problem (when all edges are cut, the graph is $k$-colorable).\n"
msgstr "Dalawang problema ang sinuri: ang [Maximum Independent Set](/tutorials/find-the-maximum-independent-set-with-aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) (MIS) problem at ang Max-$k$-Cut, na isang extension ng kilalang MaxCut problem sa higit sa dalawang kategorya. Ang Max-$k$-Cut ay katumbas din na optimization problem ng graph coloring decision problem (kapag naputol ang lahat ng edge, ang graph ay $k$-colorable).\n"

